{"3399920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinite Rails", "steam_appid": 3399920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24ce4734130f0713bd74f9c1d29614d.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24ce4734130f0713bd74f9c1d29614d.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore an Infinite World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated world with endless possibilities. Every region you explore offers unique landscapes, resources, and challenges. From rolling plains to rugged mountains, adapt your rail-building strategy to conquer any terrain. Discover new stations and routes as you expand your network. No two worlds are ever the same, ensuring a fresh experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=710 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lay Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your dream railway with intuitive track-laying tools. Connect stations across vast distances and create efficient routes to optimize transportation. Strategize your track placement to avoid obstacles and minimize travel times. Experiment with complex track layouts, including junctions, loops, and switches. Watch your rail system come to life as trains follow your carefully constructed network.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terraform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the land to suit your railway-building needs. Carve trough terrain, and bridge rivers to create the ultimate routes. Use advanced tools to shape the environment and overcome natural barriers. Turn rugged terrain into a smooth path for your trains to travel. In <i>Infinite Rails</i>, the world bends to your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/81631c18f098a3c82f1c679029dfb3dd.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=806 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/81631c18f098a3c82f1c679029dfb3dd.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/81631c18f098a3c82f1c679029dfb3dd.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Commodities Trading and Transport System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport passengers, wood, and wood beams across a dynamic network, and mine and sell coal at the coal mine to earn money, expand your operations, and purchase new trains. Keep a close eye on market price fluctuations to maximize your profits. Keep in mind that resources are limited, so plan strategically and store your goods in storages. You can also speed up production in every industry by placing surrounding booster buildings. Your strategic decisions will shape the growth of your railway empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=960 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build  stations to suit the demands of your growing railway empire or use procedurally generated ones with unique features and challenges. Strategically place them to maximize efficiency and serve passengers and industries. Upgrade stations to handle more trains, resources, and passengers. Every station is a hub of activity that brings your world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=710 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the cab and take control of your locomotives. For now, you can drive 4 beautiful models:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locomotive 702</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chme3</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V100</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class 08</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of which can be renamed and customized with different colors. Drive across your tracks, delivering passengers and cargo through a procedurally generated world. Master the unique handling and fuel types of each train. Upgrade their performance, appearance, and capacity. Feel the thrill of being both a builder and a conductor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e4b672cd5e842896c00d27e6a6135be7.avif?t=1787768867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras_big/e4b672cd5e842896c00d27e6a6135be7.webp?t=1787768867 width=1560 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Together (Multiplayer)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to create the ultimate railway network. Work together to lay tracks, build stations, and complete tasks more efficiently. Share your world-building ideas and collaborate on massive projects. Compete or cooperate in a sandbox full of creative opportunities. Multiplayer brings a new dimension of fun to the <i>Infinite Rails</i> experience. Enjoy dedicated servers support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/77305a769a77c31538e60a0426771332.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/77305a769a77c31538e60a0426771332.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/77305a769a77c31538e60a0426771332.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24ce4734130f0713bd74f9c1d29614d.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=800 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24ce4734130f0713bd74f9c1d29614d.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Explore an Infinite World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated world with endless possibilities. Every region you explore offers unique landscapes, resources, and challenges. From rolling plains to rugged mountains, adapt your rail-building strategy to conquer any terrain. Discover new stations and routes as you expand your network. No two worlds are ever the same, ensuring a fresh experience every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=710 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/8bf38937430e757ec9fb8a12910b33d8.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lay Tracks</