ery industry by placing surrounding booster buildings. Your strategic decisions will shape the growth of your railway empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=960 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/e24d859fb7c6fb69076f0bb6b43ea569.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Stations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build  stations to suit the demands of your growing railway empire or use procedurally generated ones with unique features and challenges. Strategically place them to maximize efficiency and serve passengers and industries. Upgrade stations to handle more trains, resources, and passengers. Every station is a hub of activity that brings your world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.poster.avif?t=1787768867\" width=710 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.webm?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399920/extras/7c3d67481874aaa39268c28ac34383cd.mp4?t=1787768867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive Trains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the